ts and  minds of people also must be changed and  that is what our media representations  the power to do I think that's what that  feels like disclosure have the  palliative premiering on June 19th  disclosure features interviews with  Laverne and many others as they share  their own experiences of seeing  themselves represented on screen we are  everywhere and you never know what those  positive images do for other people you  never know for the first time trans  people are taking center of their own  storytelling at this point where we're  talking really about unprecedented trans  visibility oh hey there if you want more  LGBTQ news and exclusive interviews  click Subscribe or watch these videos
 

